<!--
  VenueOS's on-screen Network screen and the "Save Wi-Fi network" card
  (2026-10-23; redesigned 2026-10-24). Read by a person standing at a
  wall-mounted screen with a remote in their hand: plain words first, no
  jargon (no SSID / PSK), one sentence that says what to do next, nothing the
  screen cannot prove (player rule 10). Translated in values-es and
  values-zh — every string here must exist in all three (lint
  MissingTranslation stays on for this file).
-->
